  "type": "numerical",
  "level": 1,
  "question": {
    "text": "<p>A car covers <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi></math> distance with first one-third at velocity <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>v</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><msup><mrow><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math>, second one-third at <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>v</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msup><mrow><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math> and last one-third at <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>v</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><msup><mrow><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math>. If <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>v</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><msub><mi>v</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>v</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><msub><mi>v</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>v</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>11</mn><msup><mrow><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math>, then the average velocity of the car is _____ <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mrow><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math>.</p><p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/ee8bbc2c-8e34-4548-b522-88b1446f24ac-image.png\" style=\"width: 230px; height: 58px;\" /></p>",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [],
  "correctValue": "18",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Let the total distance be&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>d</mi></math>.</p><p>Time taken to cover&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mfenced><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mi>rd</mi></msup></math>&nbsp;of total distance is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>t</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>d</mi><mrow><mn>3</mn><msub><mi>v</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow></mfrac></math>.</p><p>Time taken to cover&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mfenced><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mi>rd</mi></msup></math>&nbsp;of total distance is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>d</mi><mrow><mn>3</mn><msub><mi>v</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow></mfrac></math>.</p><p>Time taken to cover&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mfenced><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mi>rd</mi></msup></math>&nbsp;of total distance is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>t</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>d</mi><mrow><mn>3</mn><msub><mi>v</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></mrow></mfrac></math>.</p><p>Average speed<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>Total</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>distance</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>Total</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>time</mi></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>v</mi><mrow><mi>a</mi><mi>v</mi><mi>g</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>d</mi><mrow><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\"><mfrac><mi>d</mi><mrow><mn>3</mn><msub><mi>v</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo>+</mo><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\"><mfrac><mi>d</mi><mrow><mn>3</mn><msub><mi>v</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo>+</mo><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\"><mfrac><mi>d</mi><mrow><mn>3</mn><msub><mi>v</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></mrow></mfrac></mstyle></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">v</mi><mrow><mi>a</mi><mi>v</mi><mi>g</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn><mfenced><mrow><msub><mi>v</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><msub><mi>v</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mi>v</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><msub><mi>v</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><msub><mi>v</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>v</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mi>v</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>v</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><msub><mi>v</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p>Here,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>v</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>11</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math>, then,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>v</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>33</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msub><mi>v</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>22</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>V</mi><mrow><mi>avg</mi><mo>&#160;</mo></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>11</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>22</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>33</mn></mrow><mrow><mfenced><mrow><mn>11</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>22</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>22</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>33</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>33</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>11</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>18</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math></p>",
